{
  "name": "ondra-weather",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的天气（手册 §3.7 / §1.8 复用档）：只认显式坐标，取不到就不提。坐标写成一个 lat,lon 字段（避免「只填了纬度」这种半对状态），经 Open-Meteo 取当前实况与今日高低温和降水概率，结果只进内存缓存、默认 10 分钟一换。没有坐标、超时、返回格式变了，一律返回原因码而不是猜一个天气；不存盘、不进会话、不注册工具。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
